      "text": "Both programmes include substantial study of law, economics and public institutions. Fiscaal Recht additionally provides a specialist sequence in Dutch, international and European taxation and tax practice. UCR students can instead combine law, economics, business and governance, but those specialist tax-law components are not offered."
